            "review_title": "Review at Cari Cua 63",
            "review_text": "PinayIrschen\nIrschen12 contributions\n0\nGreat surprise\nJun 2019 • Solo\nJust walked around to find an place to eat. I saw many people sitting there and take the last table.The waitres gave me an smartphone with pictures as the Menue is only in Vietnamese. I was hungry and on the pictures the portions looked smal, big mistake ;). The Scalops was perfect tasty. The Prawns in Cury just perfect. The beef with noodles great to. Tipical Saigon Restaurant. Do not expect an great service its an authentic place where locals, expads and tourist enjoy an good cheap food. Only at the end i notice i m not in the Restaurant, its on the other side of the street. The main Restaurant is so full that they rent at night time an coffe shop to have more seats. 20$ all in just great\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
